        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">ROADMAP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669080/extras/ac52d63c650c5618368bba48c6743e89.avif?t=1768242104\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669080/extras_big/ac52d63c650c5618368bba48c6743e89.webp?t=1768242104 width=1560 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669080/extras/b2adfe9dc840be8676c8944b2e4fbd27.poster.avif?t=1768242104\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669080/extras/b2adfe9dc840be8676c8944b2e4fbd27.webm?t=1768242104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669080/extras/b2adfe9dc840be8676c8944b2e4fbd27.mp4?t=1768242104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>UP TO 16 PLAYERS !</strong><br>Up to 16 players can join the frenzy. Every game is full of surprises, chaos and laughs at your friends' expense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>COSMETICS !</strong><br>Cosmetics and outfits let you stand out but the real fun is seeing your buddies rage as you slip past them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SIMPLE TO LEARN, IMPOSSIBLE TO MASTER !</strong><br>Outrun, outplay or out-troll. Playomoji is about one thing: pure, messy fun with your friends.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">ROADMAP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669080/extras/ac52d63c650c5618368bba48c6743e89.avif?t=1768242104\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669080/extras_big/ac52d63c650c5618368bba48c6743e89.webp?t=1768242104 width=1560 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669080/extras/b2adfe9dc840be8676c8944b2e4fbd27.poster.avif?t=1768242104\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669080/extras/b2adfe9dc840be8676c8944b2e4fbd27.webm?t=1768242104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669080/extras/b2adfe9dc840be8676c8944b2e4fbd27.mp4?t=1768242104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>UP TO 16 PLAYERS !</strong><br>Up to 16 players can join the frenzy. Every game is full of surprises, chaos and laughs at your friends' expense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>COSMETICS !</strong><br>Cosmetics and outfits let you stand out but the real fun is seeing your buddies rage as you slip past them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SIMPLE TO LEARN, IMPOSSIBLE TO MASTER !</strong><br>Outrun, outplay or out-troll. Playomoji is about one thing: pure, messy fun with your friends.</p>",
